\hline
\textbf{Condition} & \textbf{Silicon Evidence} \\
\hline
Cognitive Caliber & GPT-4: ToM-15 = 96\% (median human: 85\%), ARC = 87\% (median: 44\%) \cite{Srivastava2023} \\
\hline
