FoX (weak decay head) & 0.1 per token & 10 tokens \\
Gated linear (fixed) & 0.01-0.16 per token & 6-100 tokens \\
ALiBi (short-range) & 0.5-1.0 per token & 1-2 tokens \\
ALiBi (long-range) & 0.01-0.05 per token & 20-100 tokens \\
Transformer-XL (segment) & 0.15-0.45 per segment & 2-7 segments \\
Ebbinghaus (approx) & 0.04 per token & 25 tokens \\
\hline
